     "text": "<span data-latex=\"\\pi  = 180^{\\circ}\" data-type=\"inline-math\"></span>. Тож <span data-latex=\"\\dfrac{\\pi }{6} = 30^{\\circ}\" data-type=\"inline-math\"></span>, <span data-latex=\"\\dfrac{\\pi }{4} = 45^{\\circ}\" data-type=\"inline-math\"></span>, <span data-latex=\"\\dfrac{\\pi }{3} = 60^{\\circ}\" data-type=\"inline-math\"></span>, <span data-latex=\"\\dfrac{\\pi }{2} = 90^{\\circ}\" data-type=\"inline-math\"></span>."
