     "title": "Градуси → радіани",
     "formula": "",
     "text": "Помнож на <span data-latex=\"\\dfrac{\\pi }{180^{\\circ}}\" data-type=\"inline-math\"></span>: <span data-latex=\"225^{\\circ} = \\dfrac{225\\pi }{180} = \\dfrac{5\\pi }{4}\" data-type=\"inline-math\"></span>."
